        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, hydropower, at pumped storage plant, ENTSO, summer 2018</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, hydropower, at pumped storage plant, ENTSO, summer 2018
The electricity used to run the pump storage power plant is modelled by a specific electricity mix used for the operation of storage pumps in Austria in summer 2018.;
UUID: 3d927dab-70de-3df4-9720-b0e187213824
This dataset includes the shares of different technologies of the electricity mix used for the operation of storage pumps in Austria.
Location: Austria
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3d927dab-70de-3df4-9720-b0e187213824.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
